    "Two-wheeler tycoon Vikram Lal's Eicher Motors makes the iconic Royal Enfield motorbikes.",
    "Eicher, which has four factories in India, sold more than 1.2 million bikes in the fiscal year ended March 2026, a 22% growth from the previous year.",
    "His son Siddhartha was appointed executive chairman in 2025 after previously served as managing director. In 2021, shareholders opposed his proposed salary hike.",
    "Eicher has a joint venture with Sweden's Volvo to make trucks and buses.",
    "Vikram's father Man Mohan Lal founded a tractor shop called Goodearth in 1948 and went on to partner with German firm Eicher to make tractors."
  ],
  "about": [
